					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-472887#post-1467333</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-472887/don-t-forget#post-1467333</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 01 Jun 2012 16:16:54 +0000</pubDate>
								<wikidot:authorUserId>1361261</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I feel bad for downvoting, since it's not a bad piece of writing. But I'm of the opinion that anything that further elucidates on 055 necessarily detracts from it. I don't know if the concept in this story would work as a separate SCP without being too close to 055, but the hook is different. SCP-055 very nicely grabs the reader's curiosity and produces a feeling of dread; this guy inspires pity and also a different sort of dread (&quot;wow, it would suck to be that guy&quot;).</p> <p>Tricky subject material.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
